note The PATH every child process gets: jj and git and no language server. On Unix a directory of links to the two, since git's own directory can hold a server (/usr/bin/clangd on macOS); on Windows their directories. Indexing is then tree-sitter's and deterministic, while diff and repin still reach jj and git.

